  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.4.1:\n      - Hardens the v1.4 mediator baseline with stream cancellation/disposal and exception-flow regression coverage.\n      - Expands diagnostics reporting for existing mediator processor and exception-flow registrations without logging payload values.\n      - Expands clean package install verification with a runnable mediator consumer smoke test.\n      - Includes documentation and troubleshooting polish for stream, notification, processor, and exception-flow behavior.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
